1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,469
Hello, Anna! How are you?

2
00:00:03,469 --> 00:00:06,290
Good, thanks! And you?

3
00:00:06,290 --> 00:00:09,296
Good too. What would you like to drink?

4
00:00:09,296 --> 00:00:12,061
I would like a tea, please.

5
00:00:12,061 --> 00:00:14,553
With milk or without milk?

6
00:00:14,553 --> 00:00:17,854
Without milk. And you?

7
00:00:17,854 --> 00:00:20,768
I will have a coffee with milk.

8
00:00:20,768 --> 00:00:23,392
Would you also like a cake?

9
00:00:23,392 --> 00:00:26,474
Yes, please. I am hungry.

10
00:00:26,474 --> 00:00:30,055
Me too. The cake is good!

11
00:00:30,055 --> 00:00:32,079
Is your tea hot?

12
00:00:32,079 --> 00:00:35,034
Yes. I will wait a little longer.
